Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 08:48:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/4] test(claude-eval): G256-1/2 retention inputs and time
 coherence

Ambiguous facts (bool/float readers, non-bool flags, empty audit, negative
or non-finite times), mixed aliases, malformed names and generators can no
longer yield REVIEW_CANDIDATE. Optional host epoch window and not_before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Rv89UzspoLREq2u9UkZssh
